<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Randex half year earnings double.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Randex half year earnings double.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     6.0	   vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   5.09	  vs 2.70</p>
<p>    Revenue		   11.20	 vs 3.20</p>
<p>    Exploration &amp; costs   6.10	  vs 1.25</p>
<p>    Interest received     1.50	  vs 1.93</p>
<p>    Surplus on investment realisation 8.62   vs 0.16</p>
<p>    Other income	    0.40	  vs 0.3</p>
<p>Full name: Randex Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Mineral rights firm Randex said no interim dividend has been declared for the period.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
